[\x4] u => invalid hexadecimal escape
[\u12] u => invalid unicode escape
[\cA\c] v => invalid \c escape in class set
[\z] v => invalid identity escape \z in v-mode class
[\ v => trailing backslash in class
[\x4] v => invalid hexadecimal escape
[\c1] u => invalid \c escape in unicode pattern
[\00] u => legacy octal escape in unicode pattern
[\8] u => invalid identity escape \8 in unicode class
\k u => expected '<' in named back reference
(?<a>.)\k  => expected '<' in named back reference
(?<a>.)\ka  => expected '<' in named back reference
(?<\u0030>.)  => invalid capture group name <0>
(?<a\x41>.)  => invalid escape in capture group name
[\d-z] u => invalid character class range
[a-\d] u => invalid character class range
\u{FFFFFFFFF} u => invalid code point escape
["ab"] ["𝒜"] ["𝒜b"] ["ab"]
